Linux systems utilizing SELinux are currently used in a variety of
solutions already spanning everything from mobile devices, desktops,
and critical enterprise grade systems.  We welcome any contributions
you may have, but I would suggest first becoming familiar with the
current SELinux capabilities and solutions so you do not waste any of
your time and resources on problems that have already been solved.

